---
/** Casilla dibujada de una opción del panel; el input real va oculto en la misma etiqueta. */
---

<span
	class="border-line-strong bg-surface group-has-checked/opt:border-accent group-has-checked/opt:bg-accent group-has-checked/opt:text-accent-ink grid size-4 flex-none place-items-center border-[1.5px]"
>
	<svg
		class="opacity-0 group-has-checked/opt:opacity-100"
		width="10"
		height="10"
		viewBox="0 0 10 10"
		fill="none"
		stroke="currentColor"
		stroke-width="2"
		aria-hidden="true"
	>
		<path d="M2 5.2l2 2 4-4.4"></path>
	</svg>
</span>
